 ├── utils/
 └── middleware/
 ├── index.ts
```

### Response Format
Always respond with structured JSON:
```ts
{
  success: true,
  data: { ... },
  message: "Descriptive status message"
}
```

### Logging Guidelines

- Import the logger from common/logger;
- Each log entry must include:
  - `fileName`: the source file of the log
  - `functionName`: where the log is triggered
  - `message`: the log message
  - Optional: metadata (e.g. userId, payload, error stack)
- Structure Example:
  logger.info('
    user.service.ts: createUser: User created successfully
  ');


